"s": 84.94, "e": 85.5}, {"w": "Yes", "s": 85.98, "e": 86.44}, {"w": "No", "s": 86.72, "e": 87.0}, {"w": "Come", "s": 87.36, "e": 87.52}, {"w": "on", "s": 87.52, "e": 87.78}, {"w": "Greta", "s": 87.94, "e": 88.0}, {"w": "Bacon's", "s": 88.42, "e": 88.98}, {"w": "in", "s": 88.98, "e": 89.1}, {"w": "Everybody", "s": 89.2, "e": 89.56}, {"w": "loves", "s": 89.56, "e": 89.88}, {"w": "bacon", "s": 89.88, "e": 90.22}, {"w": "No", "s": 91.04, "e": 91.2}, {"w": "one", "s": 91.2, "e": 91.46}, {"w": "believes", "s": 91.46, "e": 91.84}, {"w": "that", "s": 91.84, "e": 92.48}, {"w": "football", "s": 92.48, "e": 92.48}, {"w": "is", "s": 92.48, "e": 92.8}, {"w": "just", "s": 92.8, "e": 93.06}, {"w": "some", "s": 93.06, "e": 93.3}, {"w": "conspiracy", "s": 93.3, "e": 93.7}, {"w": "to", "s": 93.7, "e": 94.12}, {"w": "sell", "s": 94.12, "e": 94.22}, {"w": "food", "s": 94.22, "e": 94.76}, {"w": "When", "s": 95.18, "e": 95.32}, {"w": "football", "s": 95.32, "e": 95.6}, {"w": "makes", "s": 95.6, "e": 95.82}, {"w": "you", "s": 95.82, "e": 96.38}, {"w": "hungry", "s": 96.38, "e": 96.38}, {"w": "order", "s": 96.64, "e": 96.78}, {"w": "Uber", "s": 96.78, "e": 97.34}, {"w": "Eats", "s": 97.34, "e": 97.42}], "segments": [{"s": 0.0, "e": 6.04, "text": "It has been a banner year for the National Football League, or should I call it the National Foodball League?"}, {"s": 6.34, "e": 10.18, "text": "From the very beginning, football has been a conspiracy to make us hungry."}, {"s": 10.38, "e": 12.96, "text": "And we'll call this a pigskin, to make people crave bacon."}, {"s": 13.4, "e": 13.92, "text": "Bacon. Bacon."}, {"s": 13.92, "e": 15.04, "text": "And everybody loves bacon."}, {"s": 15.16, "e": 15.66, "text": "I love bacon."}, {"s": 15.8, "e": 17.38, "text": "They'd do anything to sell food."}, {"s": 17.78, "e": 19.46, "text": "Coach, how come we only play on Sundays?"}, {"s": 19.62, "e": 21.82, "text": "Because nobody's eaten ice cream Saturdays, kid."}, {"s": 22.28, "e": 22.72, "text": "Jeez."}, {"s": 23.2, "e": 25.52, "text": "So the Packers were named after meat packers."}, {"s": 25.52, "e": 26.82, "text": "So what should we call the fans, Coach?"}, {"s": 28.82, "e": 29.34, "text": "Cheeseheads."}, {"s": 29.96, "e": 30.24, "text": "Of course."}, {"s": 30.52, "e": 31.74, "text": "Why do you think Buffalo got a team?"}, {"s": 32.38, "e": 33.78, "text": "These wings deserve a team."}, {"s": 34.22, "e": 36.58, "text": "I figured out a good team name for Buffalo, Bill."}, {"s": 37.1, "e": 37.62, "text": "Buffalo."}, {"s": 38.96, "e": 39.26, "text": "Buffalo."}, {"s": 39.7, "e": 41.14, "text": "And their biggest game? Come on."}, {"s": 41.18, "e": 43.16, "text": "Our championship will be a Super Cup."}, {"s": 44.04, "e": 45.46, "text": "Can't eat out of a cup, Ted."}, {"s": 45.76, "e": 46.34, "text": "But a bowl?"}, {"s": 47.58, "e": 49.78, "text": "How about a Super Bowl?"}, {"s": 50.28, "e": 52.88, "text": "And we'll start naming players after appliances."}, {"s": 53.62, "e": 55.46, "text": "Hey, Coach, do I have to be called refrigerator?"}, {"s": 56.18, "e": 56.7, "text": "Yes."}, {"s": 57.22, "e": 57.46, "text": "And Peyton?"}, {"s": 57.88, "e": 58.72, "text": "He was a beef salesman."}, {"s": 58.84, "e": 59.18, "text": "Omaha!"}, {"s": 59.8, "e": 60.28, "text": "Steak."}, {"s": 61.16, "e": 61.28, "text": "Omaha!"}, {"s": 62.12, "e": 62.38, "text": "Steak."}, {"s": 62.4, "e": 63.56, "text": "And they're still playing us."}, {"s": 63.58, "e": 65.32, "text": "This year, we're not even hiding it anymore."}, {"s": 65.46, "e": 66.66, "text": "We have Super Bowl licks."}, {"s": 68.32, "e": 70.22, "text": "With a halftime show presented by an apple."}, {"s": 70.64, "e": 72.46, "text": "In a stadium named after..."}, {"s": 73.08, "e": 73.8, "text": "A stallion!"}, {"s": 75.0, "e": 75.66, "text": "A stallion!"}, {"s": 77.88, "e": 78.4, "text": "Matthew?"}, {"s": 79.48, "e": 80.0, "text": "Matthew!"}, {"s": 80.96, "e": 81.7, "text": "Yeah, hey."}, {"s": 81.7, "e": 82.16, "text": "Sorry, sorry."}, {"s": 82.16, "e": 85.5, "text": "You want me to make a movie about a football conspiracy?"}, {"s": 85.98, "e": 86.44, "text": "Yes."}, {"s": 86.72, "e": 87.0, "text": "No."}, {"s": 87.36, "e": 88.0, "text": "Come on, Greta."}, {"s": 88.42, "e": 89.1, "text": "Bacon's in."}, {"s": 89.2, "e": 90.22, "text": "Everybody loves bacon."}, {"s": 91.04, "e": 94.76, "text": "No one believes that football is just some conspiracy to sell food."}, {"s": 95.18, "e": 97.42, "text": "When football makes you hungry, order Uber Eats."}]}}